9-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"Also note that we could see significant charges in the fourth quarter and beyond including the possible impairment of goodwill and additional restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HSBC 2019 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Cronin","x":"Additionally, the recent modest improvement in deposit funding conditions in the market how do you anticipate that will pass through in terms of pricing?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HSBC 2019 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel Quinn","x":"We will execute a $4.5 billion cost reduction program to reduce total costs, even as we invest in the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HSBC 2019 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel Quinn","x":"This is a deep and fundamental restructuring of the Bank that will enable us to deliver on our strategy and our potential.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q1","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel Quinn","x":"Now, as Ewen said earlier on, we believe we can mitigate that impact by cost savings elsewhere in the elements of costs that are variable and under our own control that are not people related.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q1","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"On -- yeah, when Noel was talking about the pause and the restructuring program and certain elements of that, I think what that means is at the full-year, we also talked about $6 billion of cost to achieve, of which about 40% of that would be incurred in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q2","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"And we have restarted the cost reduction program that we announced in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/03/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q2","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aman Rakkar","x":"And then secondly just on restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/03/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q3","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel P. Quinn","x":"The three main levers for this are going to be: an acceleration and an increase in our investment in and across Asia; faster digitization through higher levels of technology investments; and the extensive restructuring of the businesses we talked about in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q3","e":"hsbc","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel P. Quinn","x":"Moving to slide six, we're making good progress in restructuring our US and European businesses, achieving $41 billion of RWA saves, largely through actions in Global Banking and Markets, and around $600 million of cost program savings so far this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-02-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Wong","x":"Internally, we will invest in areas, including data and analytics powered by artificial intelligence and machine learning to anticipate the needs of our customers more effectively and capture a greater share of wallet across retail, commercial and global banking.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel Quinn","x":"We've taken more than $1 billion of costs out of the business and expect to exceed our $4.5 billion cost-saving target ahead of schedule.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2020 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel Quinn","x":"In achieving those head counts and cost savings, we created a combined wholesale banking back-office function serving both Commercial Banking and global banking.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q1","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Edward Hugo Anson Firth","x":"And then the second question was restructuring charges seemed to be running some way lower than you were perhaps informally guiding to anyway, at the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q1","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"Look, on the restructuring charges, we're not changing our full year guidance we gave at the full year results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q2","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel Quinn","x":"Our RWA and cost reduction programs are both on track.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q2","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noel Quinn","x":"Early growth in both lending volumes and fee income, particularly in Asia and we're on track in both our RWA and cost reduction programs and confidence in delivering a ROTE at or above 10% over the medium-term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q3","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"Operating expenses were broadly stable, increases in investment in technology spend were offset by the impact of our cost saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/25/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q3","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"To-date, our cost programs have achieved savings of $2.6 billion relative to our end 2022 target of at least $5 billion in cost savings and cumulative costs to achieve spend to-date has been $3.1 billion with an intention to still spend $7 billion through the end of 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/25/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q3","e":"hsbc","d":"2021-10-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Rayner","x":"You mentioned you have -- about $300 million of the increased guidance is M&A related.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/25/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2022-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"In reality, for the first few rate rises, we assume we'll see a lower pass through rate rising toward or above 5% of rates continue to rise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/22/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2022-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Rayner","x":"Because I guess you're going to see pass through rates increasing as rates rise or so, I imagine there'll be some assets spread issues such as in the Hong Kong mortgage market with caps vs. prime, etc. So I just wonder if you could give us a bit more color on on how things look when you go beyond…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/22/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2022-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"We now expect to see exceed our overall target of $5 billion to $5.5 billion of cost savings, with at least a further $2 billion dollars of cost savings in 2022, and at least a further $500 million of savings in 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/22/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2021 Q4","e":"hsbc","d":"2022-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"And thirdly, from 2023 onwards, we intend to move away from reported adjusted numbers with any further restructuring costs absorbed above the line and any large distorting items disclosed under notable items.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/22/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q4-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2022 Q1","e":"hsbc","d":"2022-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"We remain on track to achieve the higher end of our $5 billion to $5.5 billion of cost savings over the three years to the end of this year, with at least a further $0.5 billion of cost savings from this program now expected in 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q1-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2022 Q1","e":"hsbc","d":"2022-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ewen Stevenson","x":"We think it is sensible to spend the money because we can drive up incremental cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/hsbc-holdings-plc-hsbc-q1-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HSBC 2026 Q2","e":"hsbc","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Georges Elhedery","x":"We are creating the capacity to continue investing for growth, including in talent, technology and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/04/hsbc-hsbc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HSBC 2026 Q2","e":"hsbc","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Georges Elhedery","x":"We have achieved this with associated restructuring costs of USD 1.4 billion lower than originally expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/04/hsbc-hsbc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HSBC 2026 Q2","e":"hsbc","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Georges Elhedery","x":"We're now planning to use the full USD 1.8 billion of restructuring costs as per our initial commitment to increase total organizational simplification saves to USD 2 billion to be actioned before the end of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/04/hsbc-hsbc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[39,1,10265,0,0,0,7812,2023],[40,1,13260,0,0,0,13065,0],[41,1,9446,0,0,0,7390,1634],[42,1,8873,0,0,0,4498,3840],[43,1,9250,0,0,0,7513,1249],[44,1,15390,0,0,0,13118,1834],[45,1,8408,0,0,0,7044,728],[46,1,8627,0,0,0,7458,800],[47,1,8735,0,0,0,6950,1280],[48,1,11326,0,0,0,9168,0],[49,1,8572,0,0,0,5846,2262],[66,1,9986,0,0,0,8239,1366],[67,1,8964,0,0,0,6570,2032]],"cinema":[[39,1,10265,0,0,0,7812,2023],[40,1,13260,0,0,0,13065,0],[41,1,9446,0,0,0,7390,1634],[42,1,8873,0,0,0,4498,3840],[43,1,9250,0,0,0,7513,1249],[44,1,15390,0,0,0,13118,1834],[45,1,8408,0,0,0,7044,728],[46,1,8627